  biomeName: The Eye of the Abyss
  minDepthMeters: 2000
  maxDepthMeters: 2500
  shortDescription: A perfectly circular 1km depression anchoring the south.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Transition biome. Come here to push deeper, find better materials,
    and work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Copper Ore and Cobalt Alloy.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Iron Composite and Copper Wire.'
  landmarkIdentity: The Eye of the Abyss reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot
    basins. Landmarks should feel large and route-defining.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets exist, but they must be earned by reading the
    terrain.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins, then
    overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Targeted node work along long rock lines and exposed shelves.
    Mid-depth: expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local hotspots, then return
    before greed stretches the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is main ridge line. This slot should read through
    parallel ridge family and stepped breaks; use bowls and hotspot rims to remember
    loops.
